title: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-references/readme
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

''HyperGSD References'' is a sub-plugin of [[HyperGSD|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd]] that adds the //Reference// type and lists to make references easy to review.

References are supporting material for your projects. It is an easy way to create additional tiddlers that are in context of your project, and existing your realm(s) of interest.

! What it ships

* the `reference` type — the `$:/GSD/Reference` tag-list member, so references appear in the new-item modal's Type dropdown and are created with the right tag (references have no status and never complete; their only structured field is `gsd_project`)
* the ''References'' dashboard page (`GSD/References`)
* the ''References'' section in the project view (the project's own references, with quick-add pre-filling project and realm)
* the "new reference" capture button in the sidebar
* the reference panel position setting (top/bottom) under HyperGSD's settings

Everything attaches through HyperGSD's tag-driven tag lists: remove this plugin and every surface above disappears without a trace, while existing reference tiddlers keep their `$:/GSD/Reference` tag and fields untouched.